---
import PageShell from '../../../layouts/PageShell.astro';

const seoTitle = 'Hypothetical: Traffic vs consultations gap | Educational breakdown';
const seoDesc =
	'Teaching narrative exploring routing friction—not a client engagement, no metrics, illustrative reasoning only.';
---

<PageShell title={seoTitle} description={seoDesc}>
	<h1>Why hypothetical traffic might not yield consults</h1>
	<p>
		<strong>Fictional framing:</strong>
		imagine Practice H with robust Search Console impressions but flat CRM inquiries. Observation often centers on modality
		overload: lasers, toxins, and membership bundles compete in the hero without prioritized routing.
	</p>
	<h2>Interpretive hypotheses</h2>
	<ul>
		<li>Organic queries land on generalized home carousel → patients stall before modality clarity.</li>
		<li>Front desk answers faster than asynchronous forms; orphaned forms yield silent drop-off.</li>
		<li>Incongruence between GBP treatments and onsite hero taxonomy confuses continuity.</li>
	</ul>
	<h2>Non-data actions teams can still explore</h2>
	<ul>
		<li>Conduct five moderated usability journeys with staff roleplaying patient archetypes.</li>
		<li>Temporarily prune hero carousel to spotlight two flagship intents + consult CTA parity.</li>
	</ul>
</PageShell>
